<p class="lead">SM IMRAN PACKAGES works with businesses to discuss and develop carton and packaging solutions according to their requirements.</p>
<div class="btns"><a class="btn" href="/products#collection">Explore Our Packaging</a><a class="link" href="/custom-packaging">Discuss Your Requirements <span aria-hidden="true">&rarr;</span></a></div></div>
<figure class="hero-img"><img src="/images/mockups/hero.webp" alt="Studio render of kraft, printed, window and partition cartons" width="1600" height="870" fetchpriority="high"><span class="badge">Illustrative visual, not a company photograph</span></figure></div>
<div class="wrap strip"><span>Corrugated</span><span>Printed</span><span>Board</span><span>Window</span><span>Partition</span><span>Custom</span></div></section>
<section class="sec"><div class="wrap intro"><p class="statement">We start with your requirements, then build the packaging around them.</p><div class="introtxt"><p>SM IMRAN PACKAGES focuses on carton and packaging manufacturing. Bring a reference carton, a drawing, a size or a new idea. We discuss it, prepare a quotation and develop a physical sample for you to review.</p><a class="more" href="/about">More about us <span aria-hidden="true">&rarr;</span></a></div></div></section>
